            <ArticleTitle>Uncommon causes of shoulder pain in the athlete.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>505-28</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Injuries to the shoulder are very common in athletes. In addition to common causes of shoulder pain in the athlete, such as instability, it is important to consider less common causes. Familiarity with these uncommon entities will lead to appropriate diagnosis and treatment in a timely fashion.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
